      "evidence": "skills/best-practice/hero/SKILL.md:159",
      "statement": "Use the shared data-point components for principle and secondary values. The hero-specific data-point wrappers, labels, values and list have been removed; do not import or use them."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "medium",
      "evidence": "skills/best-practice/hero/SKILL.md:160",
      "statement": "Use `variant=\"card-principle\"` and a `size=\"lg\"` value in the hero card header. Use a data-point group and `size=\"md\"` values for secondary information, with `lg-data-point-secondary-label` for supporting text below a value."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "medium",
      "evidence": "skills/best-practice/hero/SKILL.md:161",
      "statement": "Use `LgAlertComponent` with `status=\"info\"` for inline product messages in the hero card header. Its information icon is enabled by default; do not supply a separate icon. The hero card notification component has been removed."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "medium",
      "evidence": "skills/best-practice/hero/SKILL.md:162",
      "statement": "Always wrap hero card content with the grid directives (`lgContainer`, `lgRow`, `lgCol`)."
    },
    {
      "confidence": "medium",
      "evidence": "skills/best-practice/hero/SKILL.md:163",
      "statement": "Use the page breadcrumb variant inside `lg-hero-header`; rely on the active theme for background and link colours rather than assuming a dark-blue hero or white links."
